qos: keyboard and mouse prompts (prompts/keyboard.txt), a second prompt list beside playstation.txt.

pad_prompts_active 2 shows the keyboard list, same syntax as playstation.txt (texture/draw, replace).
A texture any list changes is marked in every mode, so it is reloaded when the mode changes; each mode
then changes only what its own list names.

